WOW-BG3 benilla patch 0030: WoW's music in world mode.
Outside BG3's fights WoW plays its own zone music and ambience; while BG3 runs a fight for BG3's
character (tav.bin flags bit 1, BG3's own combat state) BG3's combat music plays and WoW's zone
track fades out (the reference's 4.0 s music fade), starting again 8 s after the fight. In world
mode WoW's sound follows BG3's own mute (tav.bin flags bit 2: BG3 mutes when its window loses
focus) instead of benilla's headless window's focus. A POLLERR from ALSA (PipeWire's plugin) no
longer leaves cpal's output loop spinning with no sound: the stream is rebuilt.
